{
  "name": "Weekly YouTube Creator Sponsorship Vetting (Apify -> Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## YouTube Creator Vetting & Weekly Tracker (Apify -> Google Sheets)\n\nAutomatically pulls live YouTube channel stats, recent median video views, and upload cadence every Monday (no YouTube API key required), filters out low-view channels, calculates a views-to-subscribers engagement ratio, and upserts clean rows into Google Sheets.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Set `APIFY_TOKEN` in n8n Environment Variables (Apify's free $5/month credit covers testing).\n- Connect a Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 450,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Schedule & Target Channels\n\nEdit **Configure Target Channels** to swap `@handle` lists or raise/lower `minMedianViews` for your sponsorship budget.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-config",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 1 Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Scrape & Filter Creators\n\nCalls **67-labs/youtube-channel-snapshot** on Apify, keeps only valid channels meeting your minimum median views threshold, and deduplicates by `channelId`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-extract",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 2 Scrape & Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3: Score & Upsert to Sheets\n\nComputes `viewsToSubRatioPct` so sponsor teams spot high-engagement channels quickly, then upserts each channel into Google Sheets by `channelId`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-sheets",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 3 Score & Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-weekly",
      "name": "Weekly Monday Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-channels",
              "name": "channels",
              "value": "={{ [\"@mkbhd\", \"@Fireship\", \"@veritasium\", \"@LinusTechTips\", \"@AliAbdaal\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-min-views",
              "name": "minMedianViews",
              "value": 10000,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "configure-channels",
      "name": "Configure Target Channels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/67-labs~youtube-channel-snapshot/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $env.APIFY_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ channels: $json.channels }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-youtube",
      "name": "Scrape YouTube Channels (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-channel-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.channelId || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-min-views",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.medianViewsLast30 || 0) }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ Number($('Configure Target Channels').item.json.minMedianViews) }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-channels",
      "name": "Filter Active High-View Channels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [940, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": {
          "fields": [
            {
              "fieldName": "channelId"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dedupe-channel",
      "name": "Deduplicate by Channel ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1160, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "out-id",
              "name": "channelId",
              "value": "={{ $json.channelId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.title || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-handle",
              "name": "handle",
              "value": "={{ $json.handle || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-subs",
              "name": "subscriberCount",
              "value": "={{ $json.subscriberCount ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-views",
              "name": "totalViews",
              "value": "={{ $json.totalViews ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-videos",
              "name": "videoCount",
              "value": "={{ $json.videoCount ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-uploads",
              "name": "uploadsPer30Days",
              "value": "={{ $json.uploadsPer30Days ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-median",
              "name": "medianViewsLast30",
              "value": "={{ $json.medianViewsLast30 ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-ratio",
              "name": "viewsToSubRatioPct",
              "value": "={{ $json.subscriberCount ? Math.round((($json.medianViewsLast30 || 0) / $json.subscriberCount) * 1000) / 10 : 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-latest",
              "name": "latestUploadAgo",
              "value": "={{ $json.latestUploadAgo || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-country",
              "name": "country",
              "value": "={{ $json.country || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-url",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.url || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-scraped",
              "name": "scrapedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.scrapedAt || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-creator",
      "name": "Format Creator Metrics",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1380, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": ["channelId"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Creators to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1600, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Weekly Monday Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
